Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,300] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 7  | Text: 看到你在发光听你说话
Segment #2   [00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,620] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 12 | Text: 其实我做互联网的初心也变了
Segment #3   [00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,840] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 9  | Text: 我从去年开始想做培训
Segment #4   [00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,820] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为我一直在
Segment #5   [00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,200] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 10 | Text: 在底自己的潜意识里重心
Segment #6   [00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,540] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 中国的教育培训市场
Segment #7   [00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,160] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 11 | Text: 大家知道有多大实际上体谅吗
Segment #8   [00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:10,960] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 4.8万亿
Segment #9   [00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,240] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是我只需要做到万分之一
Segment #10  [00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:12,940] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 是4.8个亿
Segment #11  [00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,080] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 我做培训所有的初心
Segment #12  [00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,320] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 我是为了赚钱
Segment #13  [00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,240] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 我哪有什么情况
Segment #14  [00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,440] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 老体我吃不上饭的时候
Segment #15  [00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,120] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 谁过了行吗
Segment #16  [00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,940] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁过了普通人
Segment #17  [00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,920] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 12 | Text: 谁过了聊这个虚无偏远的东西
Segment #18  [00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,260] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 2  | Text: 没用
Segment #19  [00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,300] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是我因为赚钱
Segment #20  [00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:22,920] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 去做这件事情
Segment #21  [00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,580] | Elapsed:  17.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 我搞得我心心很累
Segment #22  [00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,760] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 我会去调调减减
Segment #23  [00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:26,720] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 我做的东西
Segment #24  [00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,460] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 我奔着钱去
Segment #25  [00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,160] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 大家听过一句话
Segment #26  [00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,320] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就要预诉而笨他
Segment #27  [00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,600] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 有的时候愧疑是卖不卖的
Segment #28  [00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,460] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 我就在想
Segment #29  [00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,720] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 4.8万亿的市场
Segment #30  [00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,540] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 12 | Text: 我做到万分之一是4.8个亿
Segment #31  [00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,980] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 我做到千分之一是48亿
Segment #32  [00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:36,560] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 大家就知道
Segment #33  [00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,400] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 周文强一年里
Segment #34  [00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,380] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 一年能做多少钱
Segment #35  [00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,740] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 周文强一年能做20亿
Segment #36  [00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,900] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后我就感觉不行
Segment #37  [00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:41,860] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 我的初心不能
Segment #38  [00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,200] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 我的初心不能是赚钱
Segment #39  [00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,060] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 我的初心要立他
Segment #40  [00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:44,720] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 我得去赶
Segment #41  [00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:45,640] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为没有这些
Segment #42  [00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,240] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 互联网的老体
Segment #43  [00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:46,880] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 我已经斗着钱了
Segment #44  [00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,760] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且我最近呢
Segment #45  [00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,680] | Elapsed:  37.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 我又认真地去整理
Segment #46  [00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,780] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 看了一下我的私信
Segment #47  [00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,040] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 以前我就从来不看私信
Segment #48  [00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,720] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 我看到了很多人要自杀
Segment #49  [00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:53,340] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 得预证
Segment #50  [00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,040] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 也让他生活没有方向
Segment #51  [00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,820] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 他不想努力
Segment #52  [00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,580] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 不想工作了
Segment #53  [00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:56,700] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #54  [00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,840] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 这人为什么得预证
Segment #55  [00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,480] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 这人为什么
Segment #56  [00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,560] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 这人为什么会产生
Segment #57  [00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,200] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 这种的想法
Segment #58  [00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,600] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 为什么想不在这个世界上花
Segment #59  [00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,840] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为他看不到希望
Segment #60  [00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,580] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 在那一瞬间
Segment #61  [00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:04,300] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 我感觉我好奇
Segment #62  [00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,060] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 我感觉我
Segment #63  [00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,780] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是在中国的交易平台市场
Segment #64  [00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,060] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 能有斗这个人
Segment #65  [00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,380] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 我在这个市场出现
Segment #66  [00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,820] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 有可能是流行发挥
Segment #67  [00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,980] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 业空趴着那一声
Segment #68  [00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,020] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是我希望我的价值
Segment #69  [00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:13,540] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 不够的钱
Segment #70  [00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,240] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 是为了让一些人找到钱
Segment #71  [00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:16,900] | Elapsed:  58.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 找到钱
Segment #72  [00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,360] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 我如果能把这个事做好
Segment #73  [00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:18,760] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 兄弟们
Segment #74  [00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,060] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 我不认为我做不到万物
Segment #75  [00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,620] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 这就要我本人都忠心
Segment #76  [00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:22,320] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 反对忠心
Segment #77  [00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,780] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们看中文墙
Segment #78  [00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:24,580] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 和我看中文墙
Segment #79  [00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:25,480] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 完全无意义
Segment #80  [00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,000] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 你懂了
Segment #81  [00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:26,900] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 我在我很小的时候
Segment #82  [00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:27,620] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 我看过一本书
Segment #83  [00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,080] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 11 | Text: 叫《世界上最有大理讨论》
Segment #84  [00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:29,880] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: W书听你意思
Segment #85  [00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:30,740] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你能一直看
Segment #86  [00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:31,560] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 最有互动的而已
Segment #87  [00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,800] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 它有填充体可以安静写
Segment #88  [00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:33,180] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 在那写
Segment #89  [00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:34,060] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 你的梦想是
Segment #90  [00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,260] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 你要通过多久的时间
Segment #91  [00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,000] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 来完成你的梦想
Segment #92  [00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,020] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 10 | Text: 我当时我看了这本书的时候
Segment #93  [00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:39,360] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 我瞬间感觉我活过来
Segment #94  [00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:39,580] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 1  | Text: 就是
Segment #95  [00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:40,560] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 我很小的时候
Segment #96  [00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,360] | Elapsed:  78.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 你想人死来世
Segment #97  [00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,160] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 他上哪里有什么梦想
Segment #98  [00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,940] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 有一种梦想
Segment #99  [00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,220] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是我看完这本书之后
Segment #100 [00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:45,140] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 我就知道
Segment #101 [00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,440] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 我想要的东西是什么
Segment #102 [00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,140] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 然后我就想
Segment #103 [00:01:47,140 --> 00:01:47,720] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 我要做什么
Segment #104 [00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,480] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 我懂得我执行我的目标
Segment #105 [00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,680] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 我和他说的那一颗
Segment #106 [00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,460] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 我就相信
Segment #107 [00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,180] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 10 | Text: 其实《世界上最有大理论》
Segment #108 [00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:53,860] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 学术员这本书
Segment #109 [00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:54,800] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 它是一本集团书
Segment #110 [00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,960] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 13 | Text: 它会让人在迷茫的书主的方向
Segment #111 [00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,620] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 它不是讲学术
Segment #112 [00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,340] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 你看着它
Segment #113 [00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:58,820] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 它起来的任务
Segment #114 [00:01:58,820 --> 00:01:59,860] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 12 | Text: 明让它《世界上最有大理论》
Segment #115 [00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,220] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 学术员它不是讲学术的
Segment #116 [00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:01,860] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是坏型你的
Segment #117 [00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:02,600] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 你可以这样理解一下
Segment #118 [00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,160] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是坏型你的
Segment #119 [00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,960] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后我就在想
Segment #120 [00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:05,520] | Elapsed: 100.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 我相信
Segment #121 [00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,840] | Elapsed: 120.62s | Words: 6  | Text: 我是相信那个作者吗
Segment #122 [00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,100] | Elapsed: 120.62s | Words: 1  | Text: 不是
Segment #123 [00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:08,820] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 我是相信我的能力吗
Segment #124 [00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:09,180] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 2  | Text: 也不是
Segment #125 [00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,620] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 我相信的就是我的梦想
Segment #126 [00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,600] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是书你还被唤醒
Segment #127 [00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,720] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我也想唤醒你们
Segment #128 [00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,260] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 你为什么我说我相信的是自己
Segment #129 [00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,080] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 你想一个女儿站在书写上
Segment #130 [00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,500] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 她从来不担心书写断了
Segment #131 [00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,300] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 她把自己书写死
Segment #132 [00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:19,900] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个女儿相信的不是书写
Segment #133 [00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:21,400] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是自己的痴狂
Segment #134 [00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,360] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要激发你们
Segment #135 [00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,000] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 对爱读你
Segment #136 [00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,140] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 1  | Text: 对
Segment #137 [00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:24,100] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要激发你们
Segment #138 [00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,160] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 我说过两晚的初心
Segment #139 [00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:25,760] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 是激发你们
Segment #140 [00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,500] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 每一个人都有能找到自己
Segment #141 [00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:28,140] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 人生的意义
Segment #142 [00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:29,420] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 并且实现自己的价值的地
Segment #143 [00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:30,460] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 只是你们现在没找到
Segment #144 [00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:32,120] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 或者你们不知道为什么要活呢
Segment #145 [00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,180] | Elapsed: 120.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 我得激发你们
Segment #146 [00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,720] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 那为什么看完之后有的人
Segment #147 [00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,600] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 路路无为
Segment #148 [00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,760] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 生活还会回平常
Segment #149 [00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,900] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 一无几往继续
Segment #150 [00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,740] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 那为什么有很多人
Segment #151 [00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:41,560] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 他看完之后以后
Segment #152 [00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,000] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 10 | Text: 他的生活真的发生了很大的改变
Segment #153 [00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,180] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 并且抓到了钱
Segment #154 [00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:45,260] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 大家知道原因在哪
Segment #155 [00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:46,600] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人看完日本书
Segment #156 [00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,320] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不去做
Segment #157 [00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,260] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不行动
Segment #158 [00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:49,360] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你要看我的直播也要
Segment #159 [00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,560] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你比如说今天我跟你们讲
Segment #160 [00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,400] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 短片如何拍
Segment #161 [00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,720] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 如何去做一名讲师
Segment #162 [00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,820] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 如何去做一个网
Segment #163 [00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:54,660] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 做一个IP
Segment #164 [00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:55,440] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 你们听完了
Segment #165 [00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:56,200] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 很多人不去做
Segment #166 [00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:56,960] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 很多人去做
Segment #167 [00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,420] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是在做与不做之间
Segment #168 [00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:59,400] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 还有很多因素去
Segment #169 [00:02:59,400 --> 00:02:59,880] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 决定
Segment #170 [00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:00,920] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么因素呢
Segment #171 [00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,940] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 中间遇到了困难
Segment #172 [00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,000] | Elapsed: 140.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的目标是什么
Segment #173 [00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,060] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 比如说我以拍视频为例
Segment #174 [00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,800] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 12 | Text: 你看我天天每天拍这么多的视频
Segment #175 [00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,280] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 我很辛苦
Segment #176 [00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,580] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 你们拿拍视频当人
Segment #177 [00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:09,920] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 我后台说过无数的
Segment #178 [00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:10,820] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 粉丝的留言说
Segment #179 [00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:12,460] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 豆哥儿我想拍视频
Segment #180 [00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,340] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 我想做互联网
Segment #181 [00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:14,420] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 我想让我的企业
Segment #182 [00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:15,840] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 通过互联网有更好的曝光
Segment #183 [00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,280] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 豆哥儿我是传统制造业
Segment #184 [00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,360] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 我快要倒闭了
Segment #185 [00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,040] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 我想通过互联网来找个客户
Segment #186 [00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,660] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 你们拿做当人的视频当人
Segment #187 [00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,700] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 当公卧
Segment #188 [00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:23,140] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 对吧
Segment #189 [00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:24,600] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 当一份专权营养家的
Segment #190 [00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,000] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 一个输入的一种来源方式
Segment #191 [00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,660] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们知道我拿互联网当人
Segment #192 [00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:29,620] | Elapsed: 161.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 我拿互联网当我的信仰
Segment #193 [00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:30,540] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是我的信仰
Segment #194 [00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:31,400] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是我的生命
Segment #195 [00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,360] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 我拿培训当人
Segment #196 [00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:35,020] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 我拿培训也当成我的生命
Segment #197 [00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,760] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 我拿着他当我的生活
Segment #198 [00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,980] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 你让我不做互联网
Segment #199 [00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:38,680] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 你让我不做培训
Segment #200 [00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,300] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 我会死的
Segment #201 [00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,940] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 我是因为热爱去做了培训
Segment #202 [00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,400] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 我是因为热爱去做了互联网
Segment #203 [00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,360] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且我有目标
Segment #204 [00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,440] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 我的目标既有我的主观意识
Segment #205 [00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,900] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 并且又符合客户规律
Segment #206 [00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:48,820] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 11 | Text: 我本身我就喜欢站在台上讲课
Segment #207 [00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:49,720] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 并且我又知道
Segment #208 [00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:50,880] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个东西怎么样能做到
Segment #209 [00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,720] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 我想要的数字
Segment #210 [00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,740] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 并且我还能做的
Segment #211 [00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:53,980] | Elapsed: 180.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 那你看这个人他不就能成了
